SUMMARY:Call for Artists! Pence Gallery Emerging Artist Award 2027
DESCRIPTION:Pence Gallery Emerging Artist Award 2027\nOpen now at www.callforentry.org – deadline is April 5\, 2027 \nThe Pence Gallery Emerging Artist Award 2027 is now open for applications via www.callforentry.org. This award supports the creation of new work by emerging artists in California and the opportunity to share that work through an exhibit and an artist talk in January-February 2028 at the Pence. Artists must use the award of $4000 to further their work in a significant direction\, and may work in any medium\, except for video or sound art. \n‘Emerging’ is defined as an artist early in their art career\, who has limited experience exhibiting\, but not an extensive solo exhibit history. The artist’s submitted work must be high caliber\, original\, and completed within the past five years. \nApplications must include a resume\, an artist statement\, and 10-15 digital images of current work\, by 9 PM PST on April 5\, 2027. The application fee is $40 ($35 for Pence members\, use MEM for code). \nThis award is sponsored by Rosa Marquez & Yatish Mishra. \nQuestions? Email Natalie Nelson at penceartdirector@gmail.com.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/call-for-artists-pence-gallery-emerging-artist-award-2027/
LOCATION:Pence Gallery\, 212 D Street\, Davis\, CA\, 95616\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/EA27_postcard-front.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Pence Gallery":MAILTO:pencegallery@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
