SUMMARY:Music Bingo
DESCRIPTION:Make Sunday evenings more fun with Music Bingo at Three Mile Brewing!\nJoin us every Sunday from 6–8 p.m. for four rounds of themed music bingo\, with four chances to win a prize. Whether you’re a music buff or just enjoy a good night out\, it’s a great way to test your music knowledge\, enjoy a locally brewed beer\, and connect with friends and neighbors.\nBring your crew\, grab a seat\, and make Three Mile Brewing part of your Sunday tradition!.
